## 26.8.1 Overview

```ruby
[coro.gender]
    [coroutine.gender.overview]

```

1 Class template generator presents a view of the elements yielded by the evaluation of a coroutine.

2 A generator generates a sequence of elements by repeatedly resuming the coroutine from which it was returned. Elements of the sequence are produced by the coroutine each time a co\_yield statement is evaluated. When the co\_yield statement is of the form co\_yield elements\_of(r), each element of the range r is successively produced as an element of the sequence.

