Dog dog = new Dog("Rex");
dog.makeSound();               // Woof!
dog.swim();                    // Rex is swimming.
dog.learnTrick("Shake hands"); // Rex learned: Shake hands

// Can be referenced by any of its types
Animal animal = dog;
Swimmable swimmer = dog;
Trainable trainable = dog;

```

